# Boozt.com

> Boozt is a Nordic multi-brand fashion e-commerce platform operating across 15 European markets. It sells clothing, shoes, accessories, beauty, sport, home, and kids products from 1,400+ global and Nordic brands. Boozt.com is the full-price store; Booztlet.com is the outlet store.

Boozt operates a per-market, per-language URL structure: boozt.com/{country}/{language}. Each market has a primary local-language version (e.g. /se/sv for Sweden in Swedish, /de/de for Germany in German). English-language variants exist for some markets but are not indexed. All category, brand, and product pages follow the same country/language prefix pattern.

Key facts:
- Boozt is an authorised retailer - all products are guaranteed authentic
- 1,400+ brands spanning fashion, beauty, sport, home, and kids
- Free delivery above a market-specific threshold (e.g. SEK 499 in Sweden)
- Free returns within 30 days with prepaid return label
- Club Boozt is the free loyalty programme - members earn points and get exclusive offers
- Boozt does not manufacture products; it curates and sells from third-party brands

